return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Doʻkoningiz uchun Zinn® Campaigns orqali doʻkoningizning oʻz nomi bilan yuboriladigan SMS va WhatsApp buyurtma yangilanishlari. Bir bosishda ulaning; joylashtirish uchun hech qanday kalit kerak emas.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Buyurtma yangilanishlari','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Doʻkoningiz Zinn® Campaigns bilan ulangan.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Doʻkoningiz uzilgan. Hech qanday xabar yuborilmaydi.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Ushbu ulanish juda koʻp vaqt oldi yoki boshqa brauzerda boshlandi. Yana Ulanish tugmasini bosing.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® ulanishni qabul qilmadi. Yana "Ulanish" tugmasini bosing; agar xatolik takrorlanaversa, Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Saytingiz Zinn® bilan bogʻlana olmadi. Hosting provayderingiz chiquvchi ulanishlarga ruxsat berishini tekshiring, soʻngra yana «Ulanish» tugmasini bosing.','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Mijozlaringizga oʻz doʻkoningiz nomidan, Zinn® balansingizdan toʻlanadigan buyurtmalari haqidagi SMS va WhatsApp yangilanishlarini yuboring.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Ulash ushbu oynada Zinn® xizmatini ochadi. Tizimga kiring yoki hisob yarating, ushbu do‘konni tasdiqlang va to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri shu yerga qaytasiz. Hech qachon kalitni joylashtirmaysiz.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns bilan ulanish','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Ulandi, biroq hozircha Zinn® bilan bogʻlanib boʻlmadi. Tez orada yana urinib koʻramiz.','Store'=>'Doʻkon','Connected'=>'Ulandi','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'Hisobingiz uchun ochiq','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Hisobingiz uchun hali ochilmagan. Tayyor boʻlgach, Zinn® sizga elektron pochta yuboradi.','Disconnect'=>'Ulanishni uzish','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Ushbu do‘konni ulash uchun sizda ruxsat yo‘q.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Ushbu do‘konni uzishga ruxsatingiz yo‘q.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qoʻllanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasini oʻqing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul koʻchirish va bittadan ortiq saytni boshqaradigan kishilar uchun yaratilgan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Har ikki tomon rozi boʻlguniga qadar mablagʻ xavfsiz saqlangan holda, faoliyat yuritayotgan saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishlarini xarid qiling hamda soting.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilans bozorimiz: yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini koʻrib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtiring va ularga narx taklif qilishlariga imkon bering.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® reliz qaydlarini ko‘ring.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® yangilash xizmati ushbu yangilanish uchun yuklab olish havolasini taqdim etmadi. Ushbu sayt Zinn® platformasiga ulana olishini tekshiring, soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Yangilanishni Zinn® yangilash xizmatidan (%s) yuklab boʻlmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish butunlik tekshiruvidan oʻtmadi va oʻrnatilmadi.']];